+# Hostile source review: Moh census rebase and OPEN[MOH-PROGRAM]
+
+Date: 2026-09-03  
+Reviewer: sol56 second-reader lane  
+Status: working draft (unsealed)
+
+## 0. Scope, frozen-input gate, and method
+
+### 0.1 Frozen-input gate
+
+I stopped before reading any mathematical input and ran `sha256sum` on the
+nine frozen copies.  All nine matched the supplied values exactly:
