+
+Recover the CDC 6500 source, a faithful listing, or an independently preserved
+run, and decide whether p.202 records an unprinted predicate, an implementation
+shortcut, or an incomplete/incorrect output claim.  The bounded present
+residual at $n\le100$ is exactly **49 excess rows / 32 excess groups** after
