+  Do not promote: that these are actual pairs satisfying semantic (3),(4),
+                  or that the mismatch proves one omitted scalar condition.
+  Replace: typed whole-factor-tree necessity; exact historical program OPEN.
+
+CLAIM (6)  CONFIRMED-BASELINE-ONLY
