+relative list.  The exploratory recenter+passport screen has no raw survivor
+at the preceding list plus 72,80,100,176; it has no further pinned-only empty
+degree.  These are exact finite-D results for the predicates as implemented,
+not claims that Moh's program used them.  In particular, the charged
+“no $D>100$ empties” and “$D=105$ has three groups” remain correct for its
+baseline but are false after the source-derived whole-tree necessity.
